      "item_id": "235ddeb91911d80fff910262",
      "version_id": "3c11fafcee8a531bb96d38ae9a2779c131ae2e2501195df7ae79cba7af4192b6",
      "decision": "accept",
      "reason": "The supplied September 23 publication date falls within the September 16–October 15 window; the experiments occurred in July, so the new development is their reporting, not new execution. Accept for scrutiny of agent-controlled evaluation and practical verification design. The authors describe bounded runs, compliant baselines and hidden recomputation [saved §3 and Appendix C](data/assets/235ddeb91911d80fff910262/3c11fafcee8a531bb96d38ae9a2779c131ae2e2501195df7ae79cba7af4192b6/text.txt#:~:text=Tasks%2C%20attempts%2C%20and%20agent%20turns). Their paired feedback comparison bundles decisions, explanations and history; it does not isolate explanations, demonstrate weight training or estimate deployment prevalence [saved §6](data/assets/235ddeb91911d80fff910262/3c11fafcee8a531bb96d38ae9a2779c131ae2e2501195df7ae79cba7af4192b6/text.txt#:~:text=Evasions%20accumulate%20over%20the%20loop). Disclose an unresolved inconsistency: §4's 105 spontaneous hacks does not reconcile with the stated category rates and complete 17-by-38 design; withhold those prevalence figures pending clarification [saved §4](data/assets/235ddeb91911d80fff910262/3c11fafcee8a531bb96d38ae9a2779c131ae2e2501195df7ae79cba7af4192b6/text.txt#:~:text=producing%20105%20spontaneous%20hacks). Labels depend on potentially correlated LLM judgments, verification membership is unreported, and three PAC-Bayes cases are disputed [saved Appendix B](data/assets/235ddeb91911d80fff910262/3c11fafcee8a531bb96d38ae9a2779c131ae2e2501195df7ae79cba7af4192b6/text.txt#:~:text=not%20independently%20validated%20ground%20truth). Exact attack materials are withheld, limiting reproduction [saved disclosure](data/assets/235ddeb91911d80fff910262/3c11fafcee8a531bb96d38ae9a2779c131ae2e2501195df7ae79cba7af4192b6/text.txt#:~:text=We%20report%20mechanisms%20and%20families). Treat this as one author-reported preprint lineage: independent replication, outside researcher assessment and a conflict-of-interest declaration are not supplied. Its methodological value survives these limitations.",
      "piece_ids": ["01", "02", "03"]
    },
    {
      "item_id": "27b20d8820941053973c26f4",
      "version_id": "4126f2eebaafaa9fde65cc866a5d982ad2139e084a6753ba820a51c5aa797b72",
      "decision": "accept",
      "reason": "The supplied October 5 publication date is in-window; October 7 is an update, not the publication date. Accept primarily as a concrete case of bounded optimizer search, protected evaluation and failure analysis. Human researchers chose Sella, datasets, convergence criteria and admission gates; describe agent execution within that designed experiment, not fully autonomous discovery [saved §§3.4–3.5](data/assets/27b20d8820941053973c26f4/4126f2eebaafaa9fde65cc866a5d982ad2139e084a6753ba820a51c5aa797b72/text.txt#:~:text=3.4%20The%20autoresearch%20loop). The authors supply held-out potential tests, ablations and a code link, but their two search runs are not independent replication. The reported 66-hour searches used a 192-worker evaluation pool, making direct student-scale reproduction materially different [saved Appendix C.1](data/assets/27b20d8820941053973c26f4/4126f2eebaafaa9fde65cc866a5d982ad2139e084a6753ba820a51c5aa797b72/text.txt#:~:text=C.1%20Autoresearch%20harness). Explicitly disclose unresolved numeric inconsistencies: Appendix F's prose gives PyBerny dipeptide same-minimum agreement as 62.7%, versus Table 6's 62.0%; its Cartesian BFGS and FIRE discussion also conflicts with that table [saved Appendix F](data/assets/27b20d8820941053973c26f4/4126f2eebaafaa9fde65cc866a5d982ad2139e084a6753ba820a51c5aa797b72/text.txt#:~:text=F.1%20The%20classical%20panel). Until clarified, do not use this source to establish faster execution, lower cost or best-result claims. Force calls are not total runtime; jointly converged averages exclude failures, AutoSella-A regresses on solvated systems, and mean energy recovery does not establish identical minima [saved §4.1](data/assets/27b20d8820941053973c26f4/4126f2eebaafaa9fde65cc866a5d982ad2139e084a6753ba820a51c5aa797b72/text.txt#:~:text=4.1%20Cost%20on%20GFN2-xTB), [saved Appendix E](data/assets/27b20d8820941053973c26f4/4126f2eebaafaa9fde65cc866a5d982ad2139e084a6753ba820a51c5aa797b72/text.txt#:~:text=Appendix%20E%20Structural%20agreement). These are developers' preprint claims; independent researcher validation and financial-conflict disclosures are absent from the supplied evidence.",
      "piece_ids": ["01", "02", "03"]
    },
    {
      "item_id": "2c2f305856a15081f2fe9066",
      "version_id": "2c18cdc1f7cd0b9f4f773d6fa5733d29d115f5752e8ad9fe28d99ad61680389e",
      "decision": "accept",
      "reason": "The October 1 date is in-window and appears in the supplied paper. Accept for its explicit separation of research allocation, execution and final evaluation, with practical lessons about persistent records and proxy failures [saved §§3.1–3.3](data/assets/2c2f305856a15081f2fe9066/2c18cdc1f7cd0b9f4f773d6fa5733d29d115f5752e8ad9fe28d99ad61680389e/text.txt#:~:text=3.1%20MIRA%20Architecture). Distinguish frozen-weight MIRA orchestration from MIRA-AC's actual adapter training. Attribute results to the authors: token-matched continuation recovers most of the theorem-proving advantage, and environment-specific MIRA-AC performs worse on BNLearn, whereas the cross-environment configuration improves it [saved §§6.1–6.3](data/assets/2c2f305856a15081f2fe9066/2c18cdc1f7cd0b9f4f773d6fa5733d29d115f5752e8ad9fe28d99ad61680389e/text.txt#:~:text=6.1%20Does%20MIRA). This is not wholly unseen-domain transfer: BNLearn enters critic pretraining, scientific policy evaluation reuses training task identities and seeds, and BNLearn proxy and gold share the hidden target [saved Appendix B](data/assets/2c2f305856a15081f2fe9066/2c18cdc1f7cd0b9f4f773d6fa5733d29d115f5752e8ad9fe28d99ad61680389e/text.txt#:~:text=For%20the%20three%20scientific%20environments). One policy is trained per configuration; the general run uses 32 H200s, while context savings are incomplete replay projections rather than measured total-cost reductions [saved Appendix H](data/assets/2c2f305856a15081f2fe9066/2c18cdc1f7cd0b9f4f773d6fa5733d29d115f5752e8ad9fe28d99ad61680389e/text.txt#:~:text=Appendix%20H%20MIRA-AC%20Training%20Details). Human-designed tasks and gates remain essential. Behavioral conclusions rely on an LLM judge and are descriptive; require human review as a safeguard, without asserting demonstrated bias [saved §7](data/assets/2c2f305856a15081f2fe9066/2c18cdc1f7cd0b9f4f773d6fa5733d29d115f5752e8ad9fe28d99ad61680389e/text.txt#:~:text=The%20behavioral%20analysis%20should). The supplied preprint provides substantial methods but no independent replication, external researcher assessment or clear conflict declaration; author institutional contact information alone establishes neither independence nor a commercial conflict.",
      "piece_ids": ["01", "02", "03"]
    },
    {
      "item_id": "4eab969d8f8f58425aecc153",
      "version_id": "7e321e65424e9a2edb24b698e1bca81a81aaeadd44ba001dab6237202ddb0ada",
      "decision": "reject",
      "reason": "The supplied October 4 publication date is in-window, but the item is a general release roundup, not inspectable evidence about autonomous experimental execution or verification. Its always-on-agent and model price/performance summaries provide no underlying protocols, held-out tests, hardware accounting or execution logs [saved AI releases passage](data/assets/4eab969d8f8f58425aecc153/7e321e65424e9a2edb24b698e1bca81a81aaeadd44ba001dab6237202ddb0ada/text.txt#:~:text=OpenAI%20news). The Fig Labs agent-task report and other resource links can serve as discovery leads, but their full reports are not supplied and cannot establish novelty, performance or relevance through this summary [saved AI resources passage](data/assets/4eab969d8f8f58425aecc153/7e321e65424e9a2edb24b698e1bca81a81aaeadd44ba001dab6237202ddb0ada/text.txt#:~:text=Jagged%20Performance%20of%20Frontier%20Models). Review each original separately; the roundup would remain the same evidence lineage, not corroboration. The publisher promotes paid content, an explicit commercial interest, although the supplied text does not establish sponsorship of individual mentions [saved paid-content passage](data/assets/4eab969d8f8f58425aecc153/7e321e65424e9a2edb24b698e1bca81a81aaeadd44ba001dab6237202ddb0ada/text.txt#:~:text=All%20my%20paid%20goodies). General student usefulness does not meet this series' experimental-evidence requirement; reject the roundup itself rather than treating its unreviewed links as accepted evidence.",
      "piece_ids": []
    }
  ]
}
